	(text "LEMO, not the bulk caps: C32/C33 sit behind the eFuse (EFUSE_OUT), which ramps them up (dVdt), and hold up the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "038f27ed-174f-524d-b3e8-a6abb334fbb8")
	)
	(text "Pack: off-the-shelf 4S BMS on the cells, the main power switch in its lead, XT30 to J3; F1 protects lights and charging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04a3475d-42cb-5757-8b48-747e07f491d0")
	)
	(text "Pole-base power board: dock (LEMO) input, ideal-diode lighting path with eFuse and INA226, 5 V for the base board, I/O expander, charger and keypad ports. Design notes are with each section."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "057a67df-ae28-59c4-905d-f613329aed08")
	)
	(text "EN_EXTILIM and writing IINDPM (datasheet 7.3.4.3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 570.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1b1b5ee4-b9c8-50df-a922-acf4283aab95")
	)
	(text "Power I2C (BQ25798 0x6B, INA228 0x40, TCA9534 0x20, keypad 0x21-0x27) on its own bus from the Waveshare board;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 473.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1d24cd37-836c-56a7-8900-b065d4c0d557")
	)
	(text "TS: 5.23k / 30.1k divider from REGN with a 103AT 10k NTC on the cells (J4; 0 to 60 C window)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 574.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2057751b-1fec-58bc-8e3c-b880d82d3660")
	)
	(text "eFuse TPS259827ONRGE: no overvoltage lockout (the pack and dock reach 16.8 V), circuit breaker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 245.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2102ad17-7414-5cf1-a8e4-2c8923eb5f7d")
	)
	(text "or plan B's USB-C modules feeding back into the dock). U3/Q5 in section 2 is the dock's separate OR diode into"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2347afd0-3ab8-5b49-acb9-7ba6ccceb8f9")
	)
	(text "SYS powers nothing (the base's 5 V comes from the power board's LIGHT_BUS); it keeps its capacitors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 558.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2347afd0-3ab8-5b49-acb9-7ba6ccceb8fa")
	)
	(text "TPS62933 from LIGHT_BUS (dock or pack, 11-16.8 V; not the charger, so the base runs without a charger board):"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 462.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2421b83b-2d69-5520-a0ea-bed176782e62")
	)
	(text "if the dock is pulled, until the base turns it back on. Defaults to on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "25b10d19-8c06-5ddf-a44d-cb4af8736944")
	)
	(text "U9/Q9: ideal diode right after the LEMO, so no current ever leaves the shark through it (the pack, the charger,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 87.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38c72099-7cf6-5c42-9d93-67ac96522acb")
	)
	(text "(recommended when hot plugging adapters above 15 V). Never enable OTG: it would drive VBUS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 554.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38c72099-7cf6-5c42-9d93-67ac96522acc")
	)
	(text "5 V, 3 A max, 500 kHz (RT open), FB 52.3k/10k = 4.98 V. L2 6.8 uH is a starting point (datasheet's inductor table)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 466.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ab98cd8-6bd9-5cc3-95c9-c6f9fca1585b")
	)
	(text "LIGHT_OFF from the expander turns the lights off; defaults to on, so the lights work without the base."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 252.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45bfa616-94ae-598a-8e68-1640875adff2")
	)
	(text "LIGHT_BUS has only small ceramics, so plugging a live dock into a switched-off shark charges ~30 uF through the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4976b731-f8e8-594f-a2d3-f36d58d4114f")
	)
	(text "INA228 on the output: 2 mOhm shunt, address 0x40 (A0 = A1 = GND); its ALERT shares PWR_INT."
